# REQUIRES: sps-scan-unary
# The exact product reason is secret-selected block-argument. These two unary
# findings deliberately pin the current scanner's imprecision, not an SPS result.
# RUN: %sps-scan --refine-address %harness/mlir/predecessor_choice_blockarg.bad.mlir | %FileCheck %s
# CHECK: [secret-dependent-branch]
# CHECK: [secret-to-public-sink]
# CHECK: findings: 2
